 %20en%20client%0A%E2%86%92%20window%2Fdocument%2FlocalStorage%20en%20top-
 level%20(crash%20SSR)%0A%E2%86%92%20%7B%40html%7D%20sur%20input%20user%20
 (XSS)%0A%E2%86%92%20%24state%20d%C3%A9structur%C3%A9%20(perte%20silencieu
 se%20de%20r%C3%A9activit%C3%A9)%0A%0AGitHub%20Action%20gratuite%20%3A%20h
 ttps%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fmarketplace%2Factions%2Fsvelte-autopilot%0A%0AV
 ous%2C%20c'est%20quel%20bug%20Svelte%20que%20votre%20reviewer%20rate%20sy
 st%C3%A9matiquement%20%3F%0A%0A%23svelte%20%23sveltekit%20%23devsecurity
