SUMMARY:🗃️ [W1] Post LinkedIn FR — Migration Autopilot
DESCRIPTION:Clique pour poster (prérempli) :\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/fe
 ed/?shareActive=true&text=Une%20migration%20qui%20a%20pass%C3%A9%20stagin
 g%20en%200%2C4%20seconde%20a%20lock%C3%A9%20notre%20table%20users%20en%20
 prod%20pendant%2020%20minutes.%0A%0ALa%20ligne%20%3F%20Trois%20tokens.%0A
 %0A%20%20ALTER%20TABLE%20users%20ALTER%20COLUMN%20phone%20SET%20NOT%20NUL
 L%3B%0A%0AStaging%20avait%2030%20000%20lignes.%20Prod%20en%20avait%201%2C
 2%20milliard.%20Postgres%20a%20scann%C3%A9%20chaque%20ligne%20pour%20vali
 der%20la%20contrainte%2C%20lock%20ACCESS%20EXCLUSIVE%20tenu%20tout%20du%2
 0long.%20Pendant%2020%20minutes%2C%20l'app%20a%20renvoy%C3%A9%20des%20503
 .%0A%0AAucune%20review%20humaine%20n'a%20flagu%C3%A9.%20Le%20CI%20n'a%20p
 as%20flagu%C3%A9.%20Staging%20n'a%20pas%20flagu%C3%A9%20%E2%80%94%20parce
 %20que%20staging%20%C3%A9tait%20petit.%0A%0ALe%20pattern%20est%20dans%20t
 ous%20les%20handbooks%20Postgres.%20Le%20fix%20tient%20en%203%20lignes.%2
 0Mais%20rien%20dans%20le%20flux%20PR%20ne%20le%20surface.%0A%0ADonc%20j'a
 i%20construit%20le%20linter%20qui%20le%20fait%20%3A%0A%0A%E2%86%92%20Lit%
 20chaque%20PR%20de%20migration%20(Prisma%2C%20Drizzle%2C%20Rails%2C%20SQL
 %20brut)%0A%E2%86%92%2015%20r%C3%A8gles%20d%C3%A9terministes%20(inspir%C3
 %A9es%20de%20Squawk%2C%20strong_migrations%2C%20Atlas)%0A%E2%86%92%20Pas%
 20de%20LLM%20dans%20la%20d%C3%A9tection%20%E2%80%94%20z%C3%A9ro%20faux%20
 positif%20sur%2050%20cas%20golden%20set%0A%E2%86%92%20Comment%20inline%20
 %2B%20check%20failed%20%3D%20merge%20bloqu%C3%A9%0A%0AGitHub%20Action%20g
 ratuite%2C%20MIT%20%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fmarketplace%2Factions
 %2Fmigration-autopilot%0A%0AC'%C3%A9tait%20quoi%20votre%20pire%20migratio
 n%20qui%20a%20touch%C3%A9%20la%20prod%20%3F%0A%0A%23postgres%20%23devops%
 20%23databasereliability\n\n━━━ Le post complet (relis avant publier) ━━━
 \n\nUne migration qui a passé staging en 0\,4 seconde a locké notre table
  users en prod pendant 20 minutes.\n\nLa ligne ? Trois tokens.\n\n  ALTER
  TABLE users ALTER COLUMN phone SET NOT NULL\;\n\nStaging avait 30 000 li
 gnes. Prod en avait 1\,2 milliard. Postgres a scanné chaque ligne pour va
 lider la contrainte\, lock ACCESS EXCLUSIVE tenu tout du long. Pendant 20
  minutes\, l'app a renvoyé des 503.\n\nAucune review humaine n'a flagué. 
 Le CI n'a pas flagué. Staging n'a pas flagué — parce que staging était pe
 tit.\n\nLe pattern est dans tous les handbooks Postgres. Le fix tient en 
 3 lignes. Mais rien dans le flux PR ne le surface.\n\nDonc j'ai construit
  le linter qui le fait :\n\n→ Lit chaque PR de migration (Prisma\, Drizzl
 e\, Rails\, SQL brut)\n→ 15 règles déterministes (inspirées de Squawk\, s
 trong_migrations\, Atlas)\n→ Pas de LLM dans la détection — zéro faux pos
 itif sur 50 cas golden set\n→ Comment inline + check failed = merge bloqu
 é\n\nGitHub Action gratuite\, MIT : https://github.com/marketplace/action
 s/migration-autopilot\n\nC'était quoi votre pire migration qui a touché l
 a prod ?\n\n#postgres #devops #databasereliability\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nR
 epo : https://github.com/marketplace/actions/migration-autopilot
LOCATION:https://www.linkedin.com/feed/?shareActive=true&text=Une%20migra
