DESCRIPTION:Clique pour poster (prérempli) :\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/fe
 ed/?shareActive=true&text=%F0%9F%90%9B%20Bug%20Svelte%205%20de%20la%20sem
 aine%20%3A%20d%C3%A9structurer%20%24state%20casse%20la%20r%C3%A9activit%C
 3%A9.%0A%0ALe%20pi%C3%A8ge%20%3A%0A%0A%20%20let%20%7B%20count%20%7D%20%3D
 %20%24state(%7B%20count%3A%200%20%7D)%3B%0A%20%20%0A%20%20function%20incr
 ement()%20%7B%20count%2B%2B%3B%20%7D%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20count%20s'incr%C3%A
 9mente...%20mais%20l'UI%20ne%20re-render%20pas.%0A%0APourquoi%20%3F%20%24
 state%20retourne%20un%20proxy.%20La%20d%C3%A9structuration%20extrait%20la
 %20VALEUR%2C%20plus%20le%20proxy.%20Mutations%20perdues.%0A%0ALe%20fix%20
 %3A%0A%0A%20%20let%20state%20%3D%20%24state(%7B%20count%3A%200%20%7D)%3B%
 0A%20%20%0A%20%20function%20increment()%20%7B%20state.count%2B%2B%3B%20%7
 D%0A%0ASubtil.%20Pas%20une%20erreur.%20Pas%20un%20warning.%20Juste%20un%2
 0UI%20mort%20en%20silence.%0A%0AMon%20reviewer%20flag%20ce%20pattern.%20G
 ratuit%2C%20MIT%2C%20install%202%20min%20%3A%0A%E2%86%92%20github.com%2Fm
 arketplace%2Factions%2Fsvelte-autopilot%0A%0AVous%20voyez%20d'autres%20%2
 2gotchas%22%20Svelte%205%20que%20personne%20ne%20mentionne%20%3F%0A%0A%23
 svelte%20%23svelte5%20%23frontend\n\n━━━ Le post complet (relis avant pub
 lier) ━━━\n\n🐛 Bug Svelte 5 de la semaine : déstructurer $state casse la
  réactivité.\n\nLe piège :\n\n  let { count } = $state({ count: 0 })\;\n 
  \n  function increment() { count++\; }\n  // count s'incrémente... mais 
 l'UI ne re-render pas.\n\nPourquoi ? $state retourne un proxy. La déstruc
 turation extrait la VALEUR\, plus le proxy. Mutations perdues.\n\nLe fix 
 :\n\n  let state = $state({ count: 0 })\;\n  \n  function increment() { s
 tate.count++\; }\n\nSubtil. Pas une erreur. Pas un warning. Juste un UI m
 ort en silence.\n\nMon reviewer flag ce pattern. Gratuit\, MIT\, install 
 2 min :\n→ github.com/marketplace/actions/svelte-autopilot\n\nVous voyez 
 d'autres "gotchas" Svelte 5 que personne ne mentionne ?\n\n#svelte #svelt
 e5 #frontend\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nRepo : https://github.com/marketplace/a
 ctions/svelte-autopilot
