SUMMARY:🪄 [W2] Post X thread EN — Svelte Autopilot
DESCRIPTION:Clique pour tweet #1 (prérempli) :\nhttps://twitter.com/inten
 t/tweet?text=Svelte%205%20bug%20of%20the%20week%3A%20destructuring%20%24s
 tate%20kills%20reactivity%20silently.\n\n━━━ Thread complet (relis avant\
 , paste #2-#5 en replies) ━━━\n\n1/ Svelte 5 bug of the week: destructuri
 ng $state kills reactivity silently.\n\n  let { count } = $state({ count:
  0 })\;\n  \n  function increment() { count++\; }\n  // count goes up. UI
  never updates.\n\nNo error. No warning. Just a dead component.\n\n2/ Why
 : $state returns a proxy. Destructuring extracts the VALUE\, not the prox
 y. Mutations lose the reactive wrapper.\n\nSame class of bug (also caught
 ):\n\n  let state = $state({ count: 0 })\;\n  $effect(() => { state.count
  = state.count * 2\; })\;\n  // infinite loop — $effect reads what it wri
 tes\n\n3/ The fix for destructuring:\n\n  let state = $state({ count: 0 }
 )\;\n  \n  function increment() { state.count++\; }\n\nFor the effect-loo
 p:\n\n  let doubled = $derived(state.count * 2)\;\n  // not $effect — $de
 rived is what you wanted\n\n4/ These won't show up in a generic AI review
 . The reviewer sees valid JS\, valid assignment\, ships it.\n\nI built on
 e that knows runes. Catches both above + $env/static/private leaks\, SSR 
 window crashes\, {@html} XSS.\n\n5/ Free MIT GitHub Action:\n\n→ github.c
 om/marketplace/actions/svelte-autopilot\n\nWhat rune trap have you seen s
 hip to prod?\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nRepo : https://github.com/marketplace/a
 ctions/svelte-autopilot
LOCATION:https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Svelte%205%20bug%20of%20th
 e%20week%3A%20destructuring%20%24state%20kills%20reactivity%20silently.
