 0%3A%20%22Bienvenue%20%7Bnom%7D%20!%22%0A%0ASpot%20le%20bug.%0A%0AOrigina
 l%20%3A%0A%0A%20%20%22greeting%22%3A%20%22Welcome%2C%20%7Bname%7D!%22%0A%
 0ATraduction%20%22AI%22%20na%C3%AFve%20%3A%0A%0A%20%20%22greeting%22%3A%2
 0%22Bienvenue%2C%20%7Bnom%7D%20!%22%0A%0A%C3%87a%20compile.%20Le%20test%2
