UID:migration-x-w3@useautopilot.dev
DTSTAMP:20260601T120000Z
DTSTART:20260624T150000Z
DTEND:20260624T153000Z
SUMMARY:🗃️ [W3] Post X thread EN — Migration Autopilot
DESCRIPTION:Clique pour tweet #1 (prérempli) :\nhttps://twitter.com/inten
 t/tweet?text=Three%20PRs.%20Three%20blocked%20merges.%20Bot%20caught%20ea
 ch%20in%20%3C30%20sec.\n\n━━━ Thread complet (relis avant\, paste #2-#5 e
 n replies) ━━━\n\n1/ Three PRs. Three blocked merges. Bot caught each in 
 <30 sec.\n\n[Screenshots of the demo repo's 3 PRs]\n\nPR #1: ALTER TABLE 
 "User" DROP COLUMN "email"\;\nPR #2: ALTER TABLE "User" ADD COLUMN "age" 
 int NOT NULL\;\nPR #3: CREATE INDEX idx_users_email ON users (email)\;\n\
 nAll three: looks fine in dev. Each one a different production-down disas
 ter.\n\n2/ Why each is dangerous:\n\n#1 DROP COLUMN: permanent data loss 
 + the deployed app version still reads it. 503s during rollout.\n\n#2 ADD
  NOT NULL no default: Postgres has nothing to backfill. Migration fails o
 utright on a populated prod table. Rollback time.\n\n#3 CREATE INDEX: tak
 es a SHARE lock that blocks all writes until the index finishes building.
  Minutes on a big table.\n\n3/ The catch + safe rewrite\, inline on the P
 R:\n\n  🔴 HIGH — DROP COLUMN permanently deletes data\n  Safe rewrite: r
 ename to email_deprecated first\, drop in a later migration\n\n  🔴 HIGH 
 — NOT NULL without default fails on populated tables\n  Safe rewrite: add
  nullable\, backfill in batches\, then NOT VALID + VALIDATE\n\n  🔴 HIGH 
 — CREATE INDEX without CONCURRENTLY blocks writes\n  Safe rewrite: CREATE
  INDEX CONCURRENTLY (outside any wrapped tx)\n\n4/ Detection is determini
 stic. No LLM in the path. The 50-case golden set has a hard 0-FP gate — m
 erge-gating tools that cry wolf get disabled within a week.\n\nMulti-ORM 
 (Prisma\, Drizzle\, Rails\, raw SQL). Postgres + MySQL.\n\n5/ Free MIT Gi
 tHub Action:\n\n→ github.com/marketplace/actions/migration-autopilot\n\nW
 hat pattern from the 15 would have caught your last incident?\n\n━━━━━━━━
 ━━━━━━━━\nRepo : https://github.com/marketplace/actions/migration-autopil
 ot
LOCATION:https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Three%20PRs.%20Three%20blo
 cked%20merges.%20Bot%20caught%20each%20in%20%3C30%20sec.
CATEGORIES:AUTOPILOT-WEEKLY-MIGRATION
